From cabd6ae763ed6ae67760f3515518201a11809351 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josh McKinney <joshka@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: cli: manage fetched Git refs

Record arbitrary fetched refs as durable review refs and add commands to
list or forget them. Include the command-level edge cases around default
remote selection, temporary backing refs, wildcard rejection, and
bookmark/new/edit conveniences.

Co-authored-by: 4evy <git@evy.pink>

